# Data feeds for the trading system (trading/). Copy to .env and fill in.
# .env is gitignored at the repo root — keep it that way.

# Moon Dev Hyperliquid Data Layer — https://moondev.com
# Live and recent data only: retention is ~60 days, which is not enough history
# to backtest a daily-level strategy. See core/README.md.
MOONDEV_API_KEY=

# Hyperliquid's own /info candle archive needs no key. It is the backtest
# history source; nothing to configure.
